<p>Hello <%= @user.name %>,</p>

<p>Someone requested a password reset for your DoFi account. If this was you, click the link below to choose a new password:</p>

<p><%= link_to "Reset my password", @reset_password_url %></p>

<p>This link will expire in <%= (Devise.reset_password_within / 1.hour).to_i %> hours. If you didn't request this, you can safely ignore this email.</p>
